    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 76,
      "y": 984,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 9.5,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 16,
      "letter_spacing": 2.4,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "A NOTE ON",
        "CONTINUITY."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-55008bbb8201",
      "role": "decorative-annotation",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 984,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "You may recognize an old idea and immediately want to improve the",
        "wording. A sentence was too long. A constraint is no longer relevant. A",
        "rough question deserves a clearer shape. Making the archive useful means",
        "allowing this kind of work, not treating every saved word as untouchable."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-60638d5b24f6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1143,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "At the same time, the past should not be silently rewritten. If you compare",
        "how your thinking changed, today’s polished version cannot stand in for",
        "what you actually wrote last month. A working archive has to meet both",
        "needs."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-dca98617c2a7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1302,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA distinguishes the original source from the editable working version. The",
        "source provides a way back to what happened. The working version gives",
        "you a place to make the material readable and useful now. Neither needs to",
        "pretend to be the other."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8f1e28d061a9",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.023",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x1": 287,
      "y1": 1481,
      "x2": 367,
      "y2": 1481,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1523,
      "width": 701,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 43,
      "font_style": "italic",
      "line_height": 51,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "The useful amount may be",
        "three sentences, not three years."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1699,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "Optional AI assistance adds another layer, not another owner. A clearer",
        "presentation can be helpful, but it must remain distinguishable from source",
        "material and human edits. An automatic update should not quietly discard",
        "the work you have already done."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-3d84d3d596a0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.026",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1858,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "When it is time to reuse something, the useful version depends on the task.",
        "You may need the original quotation, a current working summary or a few",
        "selected passages. Previewing the material is part of the choice, not an",
        "obstacle to getting it out of the archive."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b1ed7845f895",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.027",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 27,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 2017,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "Continuity does not mean never changing your mind. It means having a",
        "readable relationship between what you said then, what you think now and",
        "what you choose to do next."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-99fc79b62de8",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.028",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 28,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 2170,
      "width": 740,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 15.95,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "A product perspective, not a claim of released capability."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-1440.029",
